    {
      "subId": "7418321",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832101": {
            "id": "741832101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I never thought that vishaps could get this large.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832102"
            ]
          },
          "741832102": {
            "id": "741832102",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "Hmph. After all, they are little more than uncultured barbarians. It would be unsurprising if they grew into something much stranger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418322",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832201": {
            "id": "741832201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Speaking of which, isn't Neuvillette...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832202"
            ]
          },
          "741832202": {
            "id": "741832202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right! Neuvillette's the Hydro Dragon, isn't he? That doesn't mean that this guy's way older than even him, does it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832203"
            ]
          },
          "741832203": {
            "id": "741832203",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "A new Dragon of Water has already been born? Then again, it has been a long time since even the former Mistress of Many Waters passed... So much time has passed..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418323",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832301": {
            "id": "741832301",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "In any case, the evil dragon Scylla was once the Sebastos's friend, but he revolted at a critical juncture in the showdown between us Remurians and the... Fontainians.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832302"
            ]
          },
          "741832302": {
            "id": "741832302",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "At that time, Scylla led the brutal Dragonborn to Machimos, intent on breaching the inner city, Capitolium, where the Sebastos resided.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832305"
            ]
          },
          "741832305": {
            "id": "741832305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, the people in town were always talking about some Machimos, and a belltower or something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832306"
            ]
          },
          "741832306": {
            "id": "741832306",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "Correct. \"Machimos\" is the outer city of the capital, but should the fell dragon wish to enter the inner city, he must pass through the Initium Iani.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832307"
            ]
          },
          "741832307": {
            "id": "741832307",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "That is the barrier separating the inner and outer parts of the capital, and the Symphony weaved by the Sebastos and the musicians which covered all of Remuria passed through the Initium Iani and its golden waterways.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832308"
            ]
          },
          "741832308": {
            "id": "741832308",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "Boethius and his legions used this fact to shut the Initium Iani, thus finally sealing the evil dragon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832309"
            ]
          },
          "741832309": {
            "id": "741832309",
            "speakerId": 21430,
            "speakerName": "Monsieur Os",
            "text": "Perhaps Scylla sought to go before the Sebastos's throne, but such an opportunity is now forever lost. Afterward, the evil dragon sank alongside Remuria, and the Sebastos too was lost, remaining so to this very day..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418324",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832401": {
            "id": "741832401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, there was that time with Dvalin...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832402"
            ]
          },
          "741832402": {
            "id": "741832402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup, that bit where he kicked up a storm in Mondstadt while under the influence of a curse. We had a big fight because of it, too..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418325",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832501": {
            "id": "741832501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We had that little run-in with Azhdaha...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832502"
            ]
          },
          "741832502": {
            "id": "741832502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, he was trying to break that seal, so we teamed up with everyone and had to beat him together before we could reseal him..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418326",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741832601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741832601": {
            "id": "741832601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We encountered Apep in the desert...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741832602"
            ]
          },
          "741832602": {
            "id": "741832602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, she even went on about wanting to destroy Sumeru... And then we had to defeat the anomalous lifeforms within her before we managed to get her healthy again..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}